 begin="0:54.630" end="0:56.198">Sabat,</span> <span begin="0:56.198" end="0:56.721">azi</span> <span begin="0:56.721" end="0:58.289">lucru-i</span> <span begin="0:58.289" end="1:00.902">sfârșit,</span></p><p begin="1:00.902" end="1:09.263" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:00.902" end="1:02.992">Sufletul</span> <span begin="1:02.992" end="1:04.560">este</span> <span begin="1:04.560" end="1:05.082">de</span> <span begin="1:05.082" end="1:06.128">griji</span> <span begin="1:06.128" end="1:09.263">curățit,</span></p><p begin="1:09.263" end="1:17.625" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:09.263" end="1:10.308">Din</span> <span begin="1:10.308" end="1:11.354">apa</span> <span begin="1:11.354" end="1:12.921">vieții</span> <span begin="1:12.921" end="1:15.302">se-adapă-n</span> <span begin="1:15.302" end="1:17.625">nesaț,</span></p><p begin="1:17.625" end="1:27.246" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:17.625" end="1:19.715">Împreună</span> <span begin="1:19.715" end="1:21.806">mântuiții,</span> <span begin="1:21.806" end="1:22.328">și</span> <span begin="1:22.328" end="1:23.635">surori</span> <span begin="1:23.635" end="1:23.896">și</span> <span begin="1:23.896" end="1:27.246">frați.</span></p><p begin="1:27.246" end="1:35.357" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:27.246" end="1:29.274">Mărețe</span> <span begin="1:29.274" end="1:30.795">Sabat,</span> <span begin="1:30.795" end="1:31.302">cu</span> <span begin="1:31.302" end="1:32.316">toți</span> <span begin="1:32.316" end="1:35.357">adunați,</span></p><p begin="1:35.357" end="1:43.468" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:35.357" end="1:36.371">Cu</span> <span begin="1:36.371" end="1:38.906">bucurie,</span> <span begin="1:38.906" end="1:38.906">pe</span> <span begin="1:38.906" end="1:40.426">Isus</span> <span begin="1:40.426" end="1:43.468">lăudați!</span></p><p begin="1:43.468" end="1:51.579" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:43.468" end="1:44.482">Lui</span> <span begin="1:44.482" end="1:44.989">ce-a</span> <span begin="1:44.989" end="1:46.509">murit</span> <span begin="1:46.509" end="1:47.016">ca</span> <span begin="1:47.016" end="1:47.523">să</span> <span begin="1:47.523" end="1:48.875">fim</span> <span begin="1:48.875" end="1:51.579">mântuiți,</span></p><p begin="1:51.579" end="2:01.049" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:51.579" end="1:52.086">Lui</span> <span begin="1:52.086" end="1:53.606">I-aduceți</span> <span begin="1:53.606" end="1:55.634">închinare</span> <span begin="1:55.634" end="1:56.141">și</span> <span begin="1:56.141" end="1:56.648">Îi</span> <span begin="1:56.648" end="2:01.049">mulțumiți!</span></p><p begin="2:01.049" end="2:09.201" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:01.049" end="2:03.087">Mărețe</span> <span begin="2:03.087" end="2:04.616">Sabat,</span> <span begin="2:04.616" end="2:06.653">repaus</span> <span begin="2:06.653" end="2:09.201">ceresc,</span></p><p begin="2:09.201" end="2:17.352" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:09.201" end="2:10.220">Tu-mi</span> <span begin="2:10.220" end="2:10.729">dai</span> <span begin="2:10.729" end="2:12.767">puterea</span> <span begin="2:12.767" end="2:13.276">să</span> <span begin="2:13.276" end="2:17.352">nădăjduiesc</span></p><p begin="2:17.352" end="2:25.503" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:17.352" end="2:18.371">Că</span> <span begin="2:18.371" end="2:20.409">odihnind</span> <span begin="2:20.409" end="2:20.918">azi</span> <span begin="2:20.918" end="2:21.428">cum</span> <span begin="2:21.428" end="2:23.239">Domnul</span> <span begin="2:23.239" end="2:23.692">a</span> <span begin="2:23.692" end="2:25.503">zis,</span></p><p begin="2:25.503" end="2:32.636" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:25.503" end="2:26.013">Voi</span> <span begin="2:26.013" end="2:27.032">serba</span> <span begin="2:27.032" end="2:27.541">în</span> <span begin="2:27.541" end="2:28.051">veci</span> <span begin="2:28.051" end="2:29.579">Sabatul</span> <span begin="2:29.579" end="2:30.088">și</span> <span begin="2:30.088" end="2:30.598">în</span> <span begin="2:30.598" end="2:32.636">Paradis!</span></